# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Firebase config: holds the project's Android API key, so it stays local.
# Fetch it from the Firebase console, or with:
#   gcloud/firebase → android/app/google-services.json
/android/app/google-services.json

# Local helper that hardcodes the public ngrok URL. Stays off GitHub, because
# the backend API behind that URL has no authentication.
/run-remote.sh
/run-remote.ps1
